> [ATS][ Page][Speed][ is][ an][ open][-][source][ Page][Speed][ optimization][ plugin][ for][ the][ A][TS][ proxy][ server][.][
][Ap][ache][ Traffic][ Server][ (][ATS][)][ is][ a][ fast][,][ scalable][ and][ ext][ensible][ HTTP][ caching][ proxy][ server][.][ Former][ly][ a][ commercial][ product][,][ Yahoo][!][ donated][ it][ to][ the][ Apache][ Foundation][,][ and][ it][ is][ now][ an][ Apache][ T][LP][.][ Google][ Page][Speed][ tools][ analyze][ and][ optimize][ a][ website]['s][ performance][ following][ web][ best][ practices][.][
][We][-][A][mp][ created][ a][ open][-][source][ web][ server][ module][ which][ automatically][ applies][ the][ Page][Speed][ best][ pract][ises][ to][ a][ website][ served][ by][ Apache][ Traffic][ Server][.][
][More][ information][ available][ on][ www][.][ats][pages][peed][.][com][.]

